# The manifest decides what code `/plugin install` puts on a user's machine, so it is
# the one file here that must never merge without a maintainer looking at it. Combined
# with branch protection's "require CODEOWNERS review", this makes SECURITY.md's review
# rules mechanical rather than a matter of remembering.
#
# @trackmind-ai/maintainers must exist as a real GitHub team before this resolves.

/.claude-plugin/marketplace.json   @trackmind-ai/maintainers
/scripts/                          @trackmind-ai/maintainers
/.github/                          @trackmind-ai/maintainers

